recovery.failover.confirm.planned.body:
The scheduled migration process is triggered. The system will gracefully shut down the VM on the source site, perform a last-incremental synchronization to ensure zero data loss, and then stand up the business on the destination site.

Migration Plan: {planName}

Affected VMs: {vmCount}

This process will cause a momentary business interruption. Make sure that this operation is executed within the maintenance window.

resourceStackTemplate.field.customText.t:
### Creation Method

1. Supports two methods to create a stack template:
    - Custom Text: Edit the template directly in the text editor.
    - Upload File: Upload a custom UTF8-encoded file.
2. Stack Template Syntax
 ```
{
    "ZStackTemplateFormatVersion" : "2018-06-18",
    "Description" : "The description of the template, such as the applicable senarios and basics of the template.",
    "Parameters" : {
      // The custom parameters used to create a stack template.
    },
    "Mappings" : {
      // A multi-layered map that defines mappings.
    },
    "Resources" : {
      // The definition of required resources, including resource dependencies and configurations.
    },
    "Outputs" : {
      // The properties of resources that can be retrieved by calling API operations.
  }
```

